## Interface: 16001
## Title: GaarGpsForever
## Notes: One waypoint with an arrow, distance and time to get there, plus world map and minimap pins: /way x y, /way <zone> x y, or Alt + left-click (Option on Mac) the world map. Routes you to your corpse while you are a ghost, and remembers the herbs, ore and chests you gather: an alert near a known spot, /ggps gather points the arrow at the nearest. Shows every graveyard and flight path on the world and zone map (/ggps flights, /ggps graves). /ggps
